> squares. If that number is 8, it will be pretty easy
> to track the monster, if that number is 4, it will
> be really hard to track the monster. Despite that
> its only sensible aspect is the winking lights
> moving in a dancing cluster across the dungeon
> floor, the monster has a perfectly firm position at
> the center of those 21 squares, the adventurer's
> task is to figure out what that square's position
> _is_. Think of this as a monster with an intrinsic
> Cloak of Displacement.
